{"schema_version":1,"paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412","questions":[{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q01","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412","source_question_id":"gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q01","number":"1","order":1,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3bafdcd4cd968443f74aaf3f5490ed9f9c21f2cb565a9308cdb2c7e0f946d619","body":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 下列各组物理量中均属于矢量的是（）\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 位移、电场强度"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 磁感应强度、磁通量"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 电势能、电流"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 加速度、时间"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q02","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412","source_question_id":"gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q02","number":"2","order":2,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"13c3fde9a65c584d1da625350ef98ae28cc14409149d7a80c59dc594d8b8b25d","body":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 弧旋球，又香蕉球，是指运动员运用脚法，踢出球后使球在空中向前作弧线运行的踢球技术。如图所示是足球比赛中踢出的香蕉球场景，下列说法正确的是（）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/8d5f7b75ea80c33e6c41f5eb4c9db544e8f30974fce5cf53d1d80a5f3de74f03.png","width":385,"height":203,"width_mm":45.152,"row_group":"gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第2题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 踢球时足球从刚接触脚到落地的过程中机械能守恒"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 足球转弯时所受合力沿运动方向"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 足球在空中加速运动时，其惯性逐渐增大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 在研究如何才能踢出香蕉球时，不能把足球看作质点"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q03","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412","source_question_id":"gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q03","number":"3","order":3,"type":"单选题","topics":["光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9fc7b3c78f6f9cc5af7417bea22618f7c5ebfd036556883b1293d67fd15ce7c3","body":[{"type":"text","value":"3. 光在科学技术、生产和生活中有着广泛的应用，下列选项