":"text","value":" 。则下列说法正确的是（ ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3f040103d28e3d4c726b1212794de6784629d0237a46214c9e21045b9f57fbd4.png","width":340,"height":211,"width_mm":39.902,"row_group":"gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第12题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A．透明球体对于该频率激光的折射率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{2}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B．该激光束在玻璃球内传播的时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{6R}{c}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C．换不同的频率激光，还从 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 点水平入射，仍能出现光的“再归反射”。"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D．换不同的频率激光，在某处激光射入球体后，在球内表面可能发生全反射"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q13","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412","source_question_id":"gaosan-beidouxingmeng-2412-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"be51f747c429fa5ee000824411698d0fe10564f99468eb9c753d73cc43afe2c0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示，水平地面上方存在垂直纸面向里高度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h"},{"type":"text","value":" 的有界匀强磁场，有界磁场上边界与水平地面平行, 下边界离地高为 "},{"type":"math","value":"H"},{"type":"text","value":" 。两个边长相等的单匝闭合正方形线圈 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" ，分别用材料相同、粗细不同的导线绕制，线圈 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"b"},{"type":"text","value":" 所用导线的横截面面积之比为 "},{"type":"math","value":"1:3"},{"type":"text","value":" ，两线圈从距磁场上边界 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 高处由静止开始自由下落，再穿过磁场区域，最后落到地面。已知线圈运动过程中均不发生转动。设线圈a和b进入磁场的整个过程中，两线圈穿过磁场的运动时间分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"t_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，线圈从抛出到落地所花时间分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t'_{a}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"t'_{b}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，两线圈进入磁场过程通过线圈的电荷量分别为 "},{"type":"mat